msgid ""
"There was some error setting up inter-process\n"
"communications for KDE.  The message returned\n"
"by the system was:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"I a agut algun error en configurar las comunicacions\n"
"entre processos per KDE. Lo messatge que lo sistemo\n"
"a retornat ei:\n"
"\n"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:943
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Please check that the \"dcopserver\" program is running!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Si us plau, comprove que lo programo \"dcopserver\" esta en marca!"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:946
msgid "DCOP communications error (%1)"
msgstr "DCOP error de comunicacions (%1)"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:954
msgid "Use the X-server display 'displayname'"
msgstr "Usa l'afichage deu servidor X 'nomafichage'"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:955
msgid "Set default font to 'fontname'"
msgstr "Establis la font per omission a 'nomfont'"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:956
msgid "Restore the application for the given 'sessionId'"
msgstr "Restaura l'aplicacion per l'identificador de session donat"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:957
msgid ""
"Causes the application to install a private color map on an 8-bit display"
msgstr ""
"Ha|Fa que l'aplicacion instala una mapa de color privata sus una afichage de 8-bits"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:958
msgid ""
"Limits the number of colors allocated in the color cube on a 8-bit display,\n"
"if the application is using the QApplication::ManyColor color specification"
msgstr ""
"Limita lo número de colors assinhats dens lo cub de color sus una afichage de 8-bits,\n"
"si l'aplicacion usa l'especificacion de color QApplication::ManyColor"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:959
msgid "tells Qt to never grab the mouse or the keyboard."
msgstr "Ditz a Qt de jamei capturar lo raton o lo clavièr."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:960
msgid ""
"running under a debugger can cause an implicit -nograb, use -dograb to "
"override."
msgstr ""
"l'execucion dessot un depurador pod causar un -nograb implícit, usa -dograb per har|far pas cas."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:961
msgid "switches to synchronous mode for debugging."
msgstr "cambia tà lo mode síncron per la depuracion."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:962
msgid ""
"sets the application GUI style. Possible values are motif, windows, and "
"platinum."
msgstr ""
"establis l'estil IGU de l'aplicacion. Las valors possibles son motif, windows, i platinum."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:963
msgid "sets the client geometry of the main widget."
msgstr "establis la geometria deu client a l'estri principal."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:965
msgid "defines the application font."
msgstr "definis la font de l'aplicacion."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:967
msgid ""
"sets the default background color and an application palette (light and dark "
"shades are calculated)."
msgstr ""
"establis lo color de fons per omission i una paleta d'aplicacion (es calculen "
"les ombres suaus i fosques)."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:969
msgid "sets the default foreground color."
msgstr "establis lo color de primer plan per omission."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:971
msgid "sets the default button color."
msgstr "establis lo color de botón per omission."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:972
msgid "sets the application name."
msgstr "establis lo nomi de l'aplicacion."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:973
msgid "sets the application title (caption)."
msgstr "establis lo títol de l'aplicacion (capçalera)."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:974
msgid "forces the application to use a TrueColor visual on an 8-bit display."
msgstr "força a l'aplicacion a usar vision TrueColor a una afichage de 8-bits."

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:975
msgid ""
"sets XIM(X Input Method) input style. Possible values are onthespot, "
"overthespot, offthespot and root"
msgstr ""
"establis l'estil d'entrada XIM(X Input Method). Las valors possibles son "
"onthespot, overthespot, offthespot i root"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:981
msgid "Use 'caption' as name in the titlebar"
msgstr "Usa 'títol' com a nomi de la barra de títol"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:982
msgid "Use 'icon' as the application icon"
msgstr "Usa 'icona' com a l'icona de aplicacion"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:983
msgid "Use 'icon' as the icon in the titlebar"
msgstr "Usa 'icona' com a icona de la barra de títol"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:984
msgid "Use the DCOP Server specified by 'server'"
msgstr "Usa lo servidor DCOP especificat per 'servidor'"

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:985
msgid "Disable crash handler, to get core dumps"
msgstr "Desactiva lo manegador de petades, per obtenir bolcats de nucli"	

#: kdecore/kapp.cpp:986
msgid "Waits for a WM_NET compatible windowmanager"
msgstr "Espera un gestor de finestres compatible WM_NET"

